## 3. Coinbase x402 Specific Risk & Fix

**Observed Risk:** AI-driven stablecoin transactions may execute without adequate oversight, introducing financial & reputational risks.

**Proposed Fix:** Couple every payment trigger with a **Governance Validation Mint Unit**:
- Hash and log transaction details
- Apply pre-transaction validation conditions
- Enable rollback or freeze if validation fails

